OL,3,GNEWSAWhen and where to see the island's
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe countdown to Christmas is under
OL,7,Fway, with festive light switch-ons and
OL,8,Ffirework displays taking place across
OL,9,Fthe Isle of Man this month.
OL,11,FCelebrations begin in Ramsey on Friday,
OL,12,Fwith a countdown to the Christmas tree
OL,13,Flight switch-on outside the Courthouse
OL,14,Fat 19:30 GMT, followed by a performance
OL,15,Ffrom Ramsey Town Band.
OL,17,FA Take That-themed firework display is
OL,18,Fdue to take place at Mooragh Park on
OL,19,FSaturday at 19:30 GMT.
OL,21,FFestive events are also being held in
OL,22,FDouglas, Onchan, Peel and Castletown.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
